## Part 6: Discovery Preview Filter-Aware Count & Pagination Alignment

### 1. Problem Description
- **Symptoms**:
  - In Stepper Step 2 (Discovery Preview), when filtering by Quick Filters (e.g. `Show Existing Only`, `Show Missing Only`), Device dropdown, File Type, or search text:
    - The top count badge remained stuck displaying the unfiltered discovery total: `931 found`.
    - The summary strip showed `Loaded in preview: 931`.
    - The pagination bar at the bottom displayed `26-50 of 931` and `Page 2 of 38` instead of reflecting the filtered row count and filtered page count.
    - If rows were selected before filtering, `selectedRows` still retained the full 931 items.

### 2. Root Cause
- `app-glass-pagination` had `[length]="previewTotal()"`, which was bound strictly to the raw unfiltered total count from the initial discovery request (`931`).
- The count badge in `<span class="found-count-badge">` was bound strictly to `{{ previewTotal() | number }} found`.
- `hasMultiplePreviewPages` was calculated using `this.previewTotal() > this.pageSize()` rather than the filtered row count.
- In `setExensioStatusFilter`, only `'missing'` was updating `selectedRows`, while `'existing'` did not update the selection.

### 3. Changes Implemented
- **[stepper.component.ts](file:///c:/Users/fg8n8x/Desktop/wip/exensioreload/frontend/src/app/stepper/stepper.component.ts)**:
  - Added `isFilterActive` computed signal: detects if `exensioStatusFilter !== 'all'`, `previewDeviceFilter.length > 0`, `selectedFileType !== 'ALL'`, or `filterText` is non-empty.
  - Added `effectivePreviewTotal` computed signal: evaluates `this.filteredPreviewRows().length` when filters or client-side loaded rows are active, falling back to `previewTotal()`.
  - Added `foundCountBadgeText` computed signal: renders formatted text like `X matching (Y total)` when filters are active, and `Y found` when unfiltered.
  - Updated `totalPages` and `hasMultiplePreviewPages` to be derived from `effectivePreviewTotal()`.
  - Updated `selectAllPages()` to select all rows matching the active filter across all pages.
  - Updated `setExensioStatusFilter` to select matching rows for both `'missing'` and `'existing'`.
- **[stepper.component.html](file:///c:/Users/fg8n8x/Desktop/wip/exensioreload/frontend/src/app/stepper/stepper.component.html)**:
  - Bound header badge to `{{ foundCountBadgeText() }}`.
  - Updated summary strip to show `Showing X of Y loaded rows` when `isFilterActive()`.
  - Bound `<app-glass-pagination>` length to `[length]="effectivePreviewTotal()"`.

